-- Each agent's SOP, one row per revision (docs/sop-plan.md §6; owner, 2026-11-21): the SOP as it
-- was, what changed from the revision before, who changed it and where. A new table only: nothing
-- in the Worker before it reads or writes it, so the previous Worker keeps working. Revisions are
-- history: the runtime may insert and read them, never update or delete them (the trigger below,
